The compaction implementation under backend/compaction/ is adapted from pi's
compaction module and reworked against black's session types.

The reasoning shimmer under frontend/thinking/ is modelled on the sweep in the
Codex CLI (https://github.com/openai/codex, Apache License 2.0). No Codex code
is included and none was translated. The band width, the sweep period and the
shape of the falloff were read from its shimmer implementation and rebuilt as a
CSS gradient over clipped text.

The rest of black is original work.
